  {
   "text": "Ana planned a Christmas visit to Yosemite's giant sequoias.",
   "start": 0.3,
   "end": 3.903
  },
  {
   "text": "In winter the Mariposa Grove road is closed to cars, with no shuttle.",
   "start": 4.153,
   "end": 8.357
  },
  {
   "text": "The grove is a two-mile walk each way, often on snow.",
   "start": 8.607,
   "end": 11.985
  },
  {
   "text": "The rule: bring traction and start early.",
   "start": 12.285,
   "end": 14.544
  },
  {
   "text": "Save this for Yosemite.",
   "start": 14.844,
   "end": 16.22
  }
